As part of its cybersecurity program, each covered entity shall implement written policies and procedures designed to produce and maintain a complete, accurate and documented asset inventory of the covered entity’s information systems. The asset inventory shall be maintained in accordance with written policies and procedures. At a minimum, such policies and procedures shall include:
(1) a method to track key information for each asset, including, as applicable, the following:
(i) owner;
 (ii) location;
(iii) classification or sensitivity;
(iv) support expiration date; and
(v) recovery time objectives; and
 (2) the frequency required to update and validate the covered entity’s asset inventory.

